// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P156216057" "Hey {Hero.gender=male bro|beautiful}, how'd it go with taking down that Ajax guy? Is he out for the count?"
// Answer Text :
"P4124569265" "He was completely invulnerable Dean - and I encountered a clone of myself."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2025395056" "Whoah, <i>totally</i> invulnerable? STILL?<br><br>Ah...man, I thought that magic wore off by now! Geez, I feel awful about that.<br><br>Let me make it up to you huh? {Hero.gender=male Me and you, drinks later on, yeah? It's on me!|How about a nice romantic dinner for two later?}<br><br>But we've got a problem to handle huh? Let's see...I mean, there's gotta be something we can do about a guy who is totally invulnerable...maybe tie him down?"
// Answer Text :
"P352236826" "Ajax isn't an issue at the moment. My CLONE is."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3253245437" "....oh! Right!<br><br>Yeah. Oh man, totally, that's a problem. For sure! Two of you walking around, going against each other, {Hero.gender=male that could be vicious.|...hold on. Need to imagine two of you first. ...okay. What? Okay, okay.}<br><br>Yeah, I can see how this can be a problem."
// Answer Text :
"P2600886061" "That's why you're going to get me some information about this."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3345830929" "Oh, yeah. Yeah! For sure. It's you and {Hero.gender=male the Dean-man|D-Mac} on this, all the way!<br><br>So okay, this clone of yours, what did {Hero.gender=male he|she} look like?"
// Answer Text :
"P2935879311" "......"
// Page Seriously Text :
"P4106836309" "H-haha, just kidding! Little...you know, just a little humor there.<br><br>Let me do some digging, see what I can find out, yeah?"
// Answer Text :
"P3037682332" "Alright Dean."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P831485009" "Hey {Hero.gender=male man|babe}, you wanted info? I GOT you some info. So check this juicy stuff out.<br><br>There's this hero, goes by the name of <color yellow>Ajax</color>. Guy was the last surviving member of the <color yellow>Omega Team</color>. Crazy stuff right? Omega Team, they're the guys that went on that suicide mission to stop the Rikti in the first Rikti War.<br><br>So this guy, Ajax, yeah? Totally starts getting all depressed that he's the last one left on the team, the whole, 'Boo hoo, I watched all my friends die, it's all my fault.' {Hero.gender=male What a wimp, right?| Now I'm a sensitive guy, if you're into that, but this guy was a wimp on an epic scale.}<br><br>Years later, that whole time capsule left by the Omega Team is opened, and BAM! Juicy info flows out of it, like nectar out of a nectar-flowing machine!<br><br>Turns out Ajax was just a thug who killed the REAL Ajax and somehow got his powers of invulnerability! Man, if that's not juicy, I don't know what is. Can you believe all that?"
// AcceptString :
"P1048172312" "Dean, can you get to the point sometime today?"
// SendOffString :
"P2563496655" "Yeah! Totally, I'm getting {Hero.gender=male there!|there! I like to take things slowly babe, you know?}<br><br>So, this news spills out that Ajax is a good for nothing thug, yeah? <color orange>PPD put out a warrant for his arrest in Paragon</color>, but Ajax, he's smart, he hops over to chill in the Isles. But here's the problem. Now he's all about getting in people's business here, trying to lay down his law all up in this place.<br><br><color orange>Word on the street is that Ajax is after folks like you supers, you dig?</color><br><br>Me though, I think his invulnerability can't still be all that. Gotta be all rusted and stuff by now, you dig?<br><br>I know for a fact, for a FACT, that he loves swooping in to stop robberies. <color orange>And I also happen to be having the info that a local jewelry store is pretty light on security right now.</color><br><br>So I think you see what's gotta be done, yeah?<br><br>If this Ajax guy ain't taken care of, you can be sure he's gonna be piling down on your business at the <i>exact</i> wrong time."
// TaskTitle :
"P3447948542" "<color deepskyblue>Me, Myself, and My Other Selves</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2300988934" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Ajax and Me</color>"

