// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3923786710" "Hrm...so...yeah. I'm still not sure what we're gonna do about this. I mean, how the heck is there another version of you running around?<br><br>That's not one of your secret powers, is it? Playing a trick here on old Dean? <br><br>...yeah, I guess not."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2034751895" "Hey...so...{HeroName}...."
// Answer Text :
"P3233269220" "Tell me everything you know about this facility!"
// Answer Text :
"P1099975155" "(Punch him in the face)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1691587661" "O-okay! Look, this facility, it's been up for a while. We got it up and running during our time in the Council, right?<br><br>We only just barely got it operating now - barely!"
// Answer Text :
"P3296276288" "How did you clone me?"
// Page Clone Text :
"P1666812334" "I-I don't know! I didn't even know it WAS you! <br><br>All I know is that someone handed me the formula to use on this, and it churned out you!<br><br>Well...kind of you.<br><br>You beat it down, right? We couldn't make it as powerful as you - or as smart. Or...well...like you in any sort of way aside from your abilities and appearance."
// Answer Text :
"P1229666335" "How long has this clone of me been running around?"
// Answer Text :
"P1309291830" "What were you planning on doing with a clone of me?"
// Page HowLong Text :
"P1736037087" "N-not long at all! Just for a day, barely! We sent it in to that jewelry store to see what would happen, honest!"
// Answer Text :
"P1719769445" "Is this facility operational now?"
// Page Planning Text :
"P431585828" "I-it was supposed to be a test subject! To see if we could clone super powered beings!<br><br>We...need all the help we can get to bring back the 5th Column. This would've been it! But as you can see...it didn't go so well for us."
// Page Operational Text :
"P1574236627" "No...the clone we made of you was the first - and last - one. The systems shut down after that - I don't even know what the problem is!<br><br><color orange>It occurs to you that having a facility to create clones of yourself - or even others - wouldn't be half that bad. You could form an obedient army of yourself to wage war in the Isles! Or perhaps just to make as much money as possible. Regardless of the reason, there's far too much potential to be had with a cloning factory to just let this opportunity pass you by, or worse, let someone else use this facility."
// Answer Text :
"P503572419" "I'm taking over this facility. Starting now. Get it up and running."
// Page Running Text :
"P3338711141" "I-I don't have the technology here to do it! And we're sitting ducks with the mek men destroyed!"
// Answer Text :
"P1069665599" "Fix the mek men guards. What do you need to get this operational?"
// Page Need Text :
"P2850637169" "Okay...well...right...I think I could get the Mek Men fixed up...<br><br>I don't know...what I'd need exactly. I can tell you that we stole our previous supplies from <color red>Crey</color>. <br><br>It didn't work out too well, but that's because we only stole bits of data. If you could get more of whatever they might have, I could get this up and running.<br><br>But...uhm...well...I don't really know <i>where</i> you would find it."
// Answer Text :
"P4077852924" "Don't worry about that. Just get this place guarded, understand?"
// Page Guarded Text :
"P1189363188" "Y-yes {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}! You can count on me! I'll get started right away!"
// Answer Text :
"P70252942" "Excellent."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P767342440" "<color orange>The scientist falls to the ground, stumbling around for a few moments before standing back up.</color><br><br>O-ow! Look I said I'll talk!"
// Answer Text :
"P2762727967" "(Punch him again)"
// Answer Text :
"P2367874090" "Good. How did you clone me?"
// Page PunchedAgain Text :
"P78872490" "<color orange>The scientist doubles over, gasping for air.</color><br><br>Haaaa....haaaa...s-stop...c-come on...I'll a-answer...anything you want...c-come on..."
// Answer Text :
"P3564290719" "If you lie to me, I'll make this worse. Are we clear?"
// Page Lie Text :
"P2399598783" "Y-yes...yes of course! N-no lies! No lies! I'll tell you everything!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2033235561" "Okay...so I'm gonna wrap my mind around this. I'm gonna get you what you need, Dean-style! That's what I do, you know?<br><br><color orange>Dean takes out his cell phone and sends a flurry of text messages out.</color><br><br>I'm a texting king {HeroName}! {Hero.gender=male You gotta be one to impress the ladies.| You like a man who can text 100 words a minute?}<br><br>So I dunno what could be causing this - I heard the <color yellow>Circle of Thorns</color> did some of that weird stuff over in Paragon. But I mean, why'd they do that with - <br><br><color pink>Dean's cellphone rings to the tune of a pop song popular with teenage girls.</color><br><br>Rock! <br><br>Okay {HeroName}, guess who you're high-fiving! THIS guy, right here! I got you what you need!"
// AcceptString :
"P2517376634" "Why am I high-fiving you?"
// SendOffString :
"P1340030679" "Okay so check it out. One of my contacts, he said that he saw <i>you</i> leaping into some sewers here in Sharkhead.<br><br>But that can't be right, you know? Cause you're right here!<br><br>So that means that's GOTTA be where your other you went!<br><br>Now I don't know what you're gonna find in there, but I can tell you for sure, 100 percent D-Mac sure, that your {Hero.gender=male man|woman} is down there doing something!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1086281037" "Track down your clone"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P111447250" "How's the clone thing going? Or wait, are you the real {HeroName}?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3349156634" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: My Own Factory</color>"

