// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4129166290" "You followed the trail of yourself through the sewers and into this laboratory. You can hear the sound of a fierce battle going on up ahead!<br><br>It looks like Dean's contact told <i>every other group in Sharkhead</i> about this place!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3869966119" "Keep them back! We're not losing the lab!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P557878477" "This lab belongs to Mako now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2750325385" "Lycan Nightwolf"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4114730783" "Wolf Spider"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3554679010" "You sky pirates don't even deserve to stand beside us!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P424106976" "We'll see about that. Hand over the factory!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3406381995" "Jump Bot"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2600973341" "You idiots! You would try to destroy this wonder of science?!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4272263283" "Mr. Frost says you freaks are gonna be bad for business - we ain't gonna let this freak of nature continue!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2992410537" "Underboss"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2599793825" "You're just glorified rent-a-cops, do you think you can stand against the glory of the 5th Column?!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3056452833" "You guys are washed up! Now hand over the clone factory. Mr. Cage could use some more workers!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1549425959" "Guard Captain"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1625640157" "The Center is far too limited to contain our glorious future!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3995250345" "Hrmph, with a dump like this, it's a wonder you ever got this far! But now we're taking this for the Center!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1962278135" "Ascendant Archon"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P643143926" "We'll send you back to Recluse in pieces!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P573958768" "Give it up now and maybe we'll just turn you all into Arachnoid bait!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P343855962" "You will pay for underestimating our power!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3457310349" "Requiem or Reichsman, neither can stand against the Center!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4090899626" "Who are you pirates working for now?"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3014154397" "Classified information. All you need to know is this base no longer belongs to you!"
