// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1120678603" "No word from the other patrols. That means {HeroName} will be here any moment."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P137587586" "{HeroName}! Fire!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4036087036" "{Hero.gender=male He|She} won't get through here."
