"P1243388570" "Sting Agent"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P1476189620" "Thanks {HeroName}. But why are you...<em t=3>A cloning facility?<em t=3>Well...I know some of the revenant project's ways.<em t=3>Alright, you've got a deal, anything is better than rotting in the Zig. I'll head there now."
