// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P639827926" "You rescued Dr. Higgins!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2523288003" "Have we hacked into the computers yet?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2757252295" "There's a lot of codes to break through first, but we'll get there."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4114449740" "We're under attack?!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3321863559" "Hold it right there {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1245522143" "Anyone who doesn't remotely resemble one of us walks through that door gets an arrow in the head. Got it?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1425074090" "There! Shoot!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2793196394" "All ready."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P1579599874" "Dr. Largs"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2324876370" "Dr. Largs is known for his amoral researches within Crey - meaning that he has risen quite high in the company as of late."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1361392810" "You'll never get anything out of me. You can tell your higher ups that as well!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1761871504" "{HeroName}? This is most unexpected..."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4192241545" "We don't need anything else, this'll help us bring Crey down for good."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2414225982" "{HeroName}?! Are you working for Crey now?"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P3304039818" "Hrmph, short-sighted fools.<em t=2>I assume you're not doing this out of charity, {HeroName}.<em t=3>Hrm...a cloning facility?<em t=3>Yes, yes, I could work WONDERS with that!<em t=3>I will head there right away."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scientist2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3036004243" "You rescued Dr. Largs!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2770078497" "Maybe this will show Freedom Corps who REALLY gets the job done in the Isles."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2799774442" "Too true mate."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3741417255" "What's {HeroName} doing here?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3992658813" "Doesn't matter, we'll take {Hero.gender=male him|her down!}"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P131024596" "I'm assuming the worst judging by the radio silence. We make our stand here to stop {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2214524262" "You'll go no further {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P2908734129" "Dr. Zeist"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2478628072" "Dr. Zeist is a young and ambitious doctor, willing to do whatever it takes to make a name for himself."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4028866699" "I can't believe it's ending like this...where did it all go wrong?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P667753645" "W-what?!"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3374892619" "You tell us everything you know and we'll see about reducing your sentence."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1898036581" "Great, just what we need, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P770629636" "Whew...thanks {HeroName}.<em t=3>Crey's abandoned me for sure at this point. Do you think that I could...well...tag along with you?<em t=3>A cloning facility? Yes, of course!<em t=3>This is a perfect opportunity for me to test my new theories.<em t=3>I will head there at once!"

