// Dialog :
"P3525738913" "The Crey Scientists will be heading towards your cloning facility now. Time to speak to Dean about setting things up to take down Ajax - once and for all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P150046294" "Hey {HeroName}, how'd it go down?<br><br>Yeah? Three scientists and intense info huh? ROCK!<br><br>So now they're gonna get that clone place up and running for you, right? That's awesome! We can totally use that to take down that Ajax guy.<br><br>While you were gone he tried roughing me up for info. Can you believe that?! Going after D-Mac?! <br><br>I told him some fake info though, that you'd be in Nerva.<br><br>I can totally set you up with those psionic thing-a-majigs to put him down though!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P43339072" "Look who it is, the tough {Hero.gender=male guy|gal}. ....?<br><br>...wait, what? Hold on....someone's been doing some tapping into that kind of 'forbidden science' eh?<br><br>We knew about your psionic traps...but this...?"
// Answer Text :
"P1109323606" "So you knew about my plan Ajax?"
// Answer Text :
"P2203688441" "You didn't think you'd seen the last of me in that store, did you?"
// Answer Text :
"P1686560594" "I'm not here to talk, Ajax. (Activate Psionic Trap)"
// Page Second Text :
"P573465998" "<color orange>Ajax lays on the ground, barely able to move.</color><br><br>So...that was it...huh...? That was all...I could do?"
// Answer Text :
"P1082813715" "You're not too impressive for a man who can't be hurt."
// Answer Text :
"P2127840657" "You didn't do too bad, Ajax. But I had to put you down."
// Answer Text :
"P3054010555" "What did you think you could do against -me-?"
// Page NotImpressed Text :
"P2970571421" "Maybe...maybe I'm not.<br><br>I couldn't even...do good in a place...crawling with scum like...<i>you</i>."
// Answer Text :
"P2789878623" "No, you couldn't. And that's why you failed here."
// Page Failed Text :
"P342405864" "So...now what?<br><br>Just...finish me off! I don't care...you probably found a way to kill me...maybe this is how the last Ajax felt, before I killed him."
// Answer Text :
"P3917058922" "Unfortunately for me, I don't have a way to kill you just yet."
// Page JustYet Text :
"P797302089" "Then...what?"
// Answer Text :
"P3703215643" "That isn't for you to know. (Knock out Ajax)"
// Page KO Text :
"P2267092692" "<color orange>With his mind scrambled, Ajax is easily knocked out. You tag him with the device Dean gave you, causing Ajax to instantly vanish before your eyes.<br><br>If everything works out properly, Ajax will be out of your hair now - forever.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P762817480" "Now to get some answers from Dean..."
// Page IHadTo Text :
"P3335687976" "Hmph...<i>had</i> to...huh?"
// Answer Text :
"P3653422969" "You were in the way, Ajax, you were going to cause me nothing but problems."
// Page NothingButProblems Text :
"P3543548916" "So that was it then? No vendetta against me? No personal vengeance, no hatred?"
// Answer Text :
"P1593242264" "Not my style, Ajax."
// Page WhatDidYouThink Text :
"P2272453797" "I was going to...stop you! <br><br>Put an end to you before you grew out of control! For the Isles...for Paragon...for the sake of the world!"
// Answer Text :
"P2192913286" "Put an end? To -me-? Hah! You're pathetic!"
// Page Pathetic Text :
"P1399396570" "<color orange>Ajax snarls at you.</color><br><br>Maybe...maybe I am. But as long as I live...I'll do everything I can to stop you. I swear it!"
// Answer Text :
"P1882519247" "I don't think so, Ajax. I have plans for you."
// Page IHavePlans Text :
"P2175804273" "Plans? What are you talking about?"
// Answer Text :
"P1657995510" "Oh, you'll see Ajax. (Knock out Ajax)"
// Page NotMyStyle Text :
"P547019770" "<color orange>Ajax looks up towards the sky with a pained sigh.</color><br><br>I just...wanted to try to do good. All my life...I messed things up...<br><br>I accidentally kill the former Ajax...I let all the Omega Team down...<br><br>...and now this. I couldn't even defeat <i>you</i>.<br><br>Just...just end it, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1132303641" "This here is ending Ajax, but not your life."
// Page ChapterEnd Text :
"P110491924" "I guess...I wouldn't be that lucky...<br><br>Fine...{HeroName}...just do...do whatever it is you came here to do."
// Answer Text :
"P3092878816" "(Knock out Ajax)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P304234915" "I knew about the trap deal, {Hero.gender=male buddy|cupcake}. Not this whole freakshow of clones, though.<br><br> Do you really think that if you just throw more of you at me that I can be beaten?<br><br>Nothing is going to stop me - not the Rikti, not the so-called 'law' in Paragon - nobody!"
// Answer Text :
"P85187883" "I'm not here to kill you, Ajax. There are other plans."
// Page OtherPlans Text :
"P477687134" "Other plans? What are you going on about?"
// Answer Text :
"P504032287" "You'll find out soon enough! (Activate Psionic Trap)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2827456874" "I was hoping I didn't - I've been itchin' to hand you your head ever since I saw you in that store, {Hero.gender=male chief|sweetlips}.<br><br>I'll have a good laugh while I beat you into the ground!"
// Answer Text :
"P3246489296" "Funny. Me and my other self will enjoy beating you! (Activate Psionic Trap)"
// Page TrapActivate Text :
"P2272559095" "<color orange>You push the device to activate the trap, only for it to short-circuit. It appears Wyvern has jammed the frequency of your device!</color><br><br>Looks like you lose, {Hero.gender=male hombre|buttercup}."
// Answer Text :
"P2872172300" "No. It just means I'll have to do this myself!"
// Page ChangeinPlans Text :
"P3263822069" "I'll stomp you into the ground before you get the chance!"
// Answer Text :
"P2732442058" "I'd love to see you try!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Shadowy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P65916189" "{HeroName}. Good to see you. You're here for the devices, correct?<br><br>I've got men delivering them now, you just name the place."
// Answer Text :
"P2818158736" "Liberty Island. Ajax should be there now."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2413100217" "Liberty Island? Understood. Dean has handled all the payments for you.<br><br>Take this device. When Ajax is in sight, just hit the button and the psionic devices will activate, assaulting Ajax's mind."
// Answer Text :
"P1960768528" "And if the device doesn't work?"
// Page Doesnt Text :
"P3290997588" "The device <i>will</i> work."
// Answer Text :
"P1922310828" "And if it doesn't?"
// Page Seriously Text :
"P722368852" ".....<br><br>If it doesn't work, the second option is to just destroy them. The psionics are set up to target Ajax when they're released - destroying the machines will do that. Though, it will also destroy the machines. Obviously."
// Answer Text :
"P3429184782" "Good to know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeanFinale 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2325073643" "{HeroName}! What's uuuup! High five on taking down Ajax!"
// Answer Text :
"P2658550346" "Where is he now?"
// Answer Text :
"P2410883428" "I'm never going to high five you Dean. Tell me who took Ajax."
// Answer Text :
"P1897392822" "(High-five Dean)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3554296545" "Huh?<br><br>Oh, I have no idea. The guy that I was talking to didn't say, just that he promised to keep Ajax outta our hair for good."
// Answer Text :
"P3807040496" "...who is this guy?"
// Page Who Text :
"P3362505353" "Well, to be honest, the guy's face and all was concealed. BUT, here's the weird thing.<br><br>Straight up, he told me he figured you'd be curious about him. So he said in the event that you were looking into who he was and what happened to give you this letter to read over.<br><br> <color orange>Dean hands you an unopened envelope with a letter inside of it.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2989653162" "(Read the letter)"
// Page Letter Text :
"P1284719923" "<color orange>You read over the letter...</color><br><br><i>Dear {HeroName}...<br><br>This may be the first letter of mine that you're receiving, or the last. Have you visited Ouroboros yet? I suppose that question does not matter - if you have, then you know to be wary. If not, then you have been warned.<br><br>You are no doubt wondering what has happened to Ajax. I assure you that you have not been double-crossed - I respect you far too much to do something as banal as 'lie' to you. Yes, I used you to get to Ajax, much like you used Dean to get what you wanted. However, both of us have benefitted from this, as Ajax is now where he needs to be.<br><br>There is a storm on the horizon - one that you are either all too familiar with, or one that you will soon come to know. I am gathering a team of sorts to deal with this - properly. <br><br>Mender Silos of Ouroboros has his followers who do his dirty work for him. Ajax shall be one of the few who will be on my team. I do not use the term 'follower', as that implies I believe myself to be higher than those who aid me - much like Mender Silos does.<br><br>The time is coming soon when sides must be taken, {HeroName}. I would ask that you choose to side with myself when that day arrives. Silos will use you for his own ends - I, however, will do everything I can to work with you, to aid you.<br><br>As I mentioned earlier, this may be the first letter of mine you received, or the very last. Regardless of that, I shall see you in the pillar of fire and ice, when the time comes. I hope then you will make the right, and informed, choice of who you will support.</i>"
// Answer Text :
"P3373279309" "Dean, you don't know who gave you this letter?"
// Page DontKnow Text :
"P514305664" "No idea {Hero.gender=male bro|babe}, like I said, dude was all mysterious-like, I couldn't see his face or anything.<br><br>But I know he was a guy! If there's one thing D-Mac knows, it's what gender someone is.<br><br>Hey so did your clones work out OK?"
// Answer Text :
"P1138658917" "Not exactly. Why?"
// Page Notexactly Text :
"P4255659385" "There's this guy, name's <color yellow>Leonard</color>, weird kinda guy. He was looking around for you before.<br><br>He said that he was really interested in helping out with getting your cloning factory up and running. <br><br>I figure if you're interested, I can give him a ring and hook you up, yeah?"
// Answer Text :
"P323601430" "That sounds like a plan Dean, make it so."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3714861392" "<color orange>You and Dean share an intense high-five together.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P328561640" "Now tell me where Ajax is."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2169982618" "Man, this is gonna be so intense {HeroName}! My hands are shaking in anticipation!<br><br>So okay, I did some legwork and talked to some people. D-Mac really put in the extra hours for this one.<br><br>I got in touch with those scientists of yours, they said they're gonna have a clone of you all ready to ship out pretty soon. Which is awesome.<br><br>And Ajax, he's all in Nerva, trying to see where your face is so he can punch it.<br><br>Now, this is the part where you give me a wicked high-five, or at least a fist bump. I got a contact in here in Sharkhead, said he could hook you up with those psionic projectors! I know, whaaaaat!<br><br>AND, I got that other guy to agree to lug Ajax away once you're all done with him! Even gave me a device to do it with! High five time for Dean!"
// AcceptString :
"P452035723" "Alright Dean. Tell me who your contact is in Sharkhead."
// SendOffString :
"P2215953137" "Well...okay. So the dude you're going to is called <color yellow>Lt. Chalmers</color>. Guy is former SAS and in the Sky Raiders now, crazy story right?<br><br>I got another pal who is in the Sky Raiders, he's OK, kind of uptight and idealistic, but whatever. Real mook that guy is, I think that's what they say.<br><br><color orange>I figure you can go talk to Chalmers and he'll hook you up with what you gotta do. Your science boys told me they'll send your clone over when you give them the word.</color><br><br>Oh yeah, that guy? You know, the guy. The one who is gonna truck off Ajax. Told me to give you this weird looking device.<br><br><color orange>He said when Ajax is down, tag him with this and it'll 'keep Ajax out of your hair for a very long time'.</color> Nice huh?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1758071341" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: My Worst Enemy</color>"

