// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3088752146" "<shout>{HeroName}! {Hero.gender=male Face me like a man!|Come out and face me!}"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3912117761" "I haven't felt pain in a while {HeroName}, I'll give you some credit for that!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1779892813" "But you can't put me down, this is all just temporary. I'm immortal, unkillable!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3980557180" "Even if I fall here...I'll still return...that's my fate...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P458576430" "What...where am I...going...?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P66516549" "I'm taking you down! The Rogue Isles belong to ME!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P837393794" "Agh...hah...is that it, {HeroName}?! It'll take more than that to put me down!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1990572746" "You're...nothing...I didn't survive the Rikti War...to be beaten by YOU!"
