// Dialog :
"P777434392" "The letter you received was somewhat odd, but what seems promising is this Sir Leonard, who wishes to help fund your operations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1682807679" "{HeroName}, I have to say, me and you working together, side by side, it's been great. A pleasure, and an honor. If you ever need someone to get you info on what's good in the Isles, I'm your go to guy. Or if you want to {Hero.gender=male just chill out,|go out on a nice romantic dinner in Aeon City,} you just let me know, and I will be there in a HEARTBEAT. You and me, we're gonna be comrades forever, FOREVER!"

